          "kind": "field:title",
          "line": 117,
          "value": "01. Share Your Travel Plan"
        },
        {
          "kind": "field:description",
          "line": 118,
          "value": "Tell us your arrival city, dates, traveler count, mode of arrival, and specific stay or local assistance needs."
        },
        {
          "kind": "field:title",
          "line": 121,
          "value": "02. Receive Custom Travel Scope"
        },
        {
          "kind": "field:description",
          "line": 122,
          "value": "Our travel team reviews your route, verifies partner availability, and prepares a transparent service plan."
        },
        {
          "kind": "field:title",
          "line": 125,
          "value": "03. On-Trip Shadow Assistance"
        },
        {
          "kind": "field:description",
          "line": 126,
          "value": "Enjoy dedicated airport/station pickup, local ground transfers, hotel stay coordination, and Shadow Assist."
        },
        {
          "kind": "field:title",
          "line": 129,
          "value": "04. Safe Departure & Support"
        },
        {
          "kind": "field:description",
          "line": 130,
          "value": "Receive 247 live support throughout your stay until your safe departure and journey completion."
        },
        {
          "kind": "field:question",
          "line": 136,
          "value": "What is the Shadow Traveler concept?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "field:answer",
          "line": 137,
          "value": "Our Shadow Traveler approach means we act as your local ground companion—always with you, always for you. We manage pickups, stays, local navigation, and unexpected needs while you focus on your journey."
        },
        {
          "kind": "field:question",
          "line": 140,
          "value": "Can you arrange airport or railway station pickups?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "field:answer",
          "line": 141,
          "value": "Yes! Airport and railway station pickups can be coordinated after you share your arrival details, passenger count, destination, and timing."
        },
        {
          "kind": "field:question",
          "line": 144,
          "value": "Is travel assistance available for NRIs and international visitors?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "field:answer",
          "line": 145,
          "value": "Yes. We provide complete travel assistance for NRIs and international families visiting India and Nepal, including airport connection, multi-lingual coordination, and stay management."
        },
        {
          "kind": "field:question",
          "line": 148,
          "value": "How are Travel Assistance Partners verified?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "field:answer",
          "line": 149,
          "value": "All partners undergo mandatory background screening, identity verification, experience checks, and service certification before joining our network."
        },
        {
          "kind": "field:question",
          "line": 152,
          "value": "Can travel assistance be combined with PitruMoksha or Ritual Services?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "field:answer",
          "line": 153,
          "value": "Yes. Travel assistance can be seamlessly combined with your ancestral rites or puja ceremonies so that local transport, stay, and priest coordination are unified."
        },
        {
          "kind": "field:question",
          "line": 156,
          "value": "What happens if my travel dates or arrival times change during the trip?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "field:answer",
          "line": 157,
          "value": "Our 247 On-Trip Support team handles live itinerary adjustments, flight/train delay tracking, and rescheduled local pickups."
        },
        {
          "kind": "jsx-text",
          "line": 167,
          "value": "DEDICATED JOURNEY MANAGEMENT"
        },
        {
          "kind": "jsx-text",
          "line": 168,
          "value": "Travel with Confidence. Return with Peace of Mind."
        },
        {
          "kind": "jsx-text",
          "line": 170,
          "value": "Connect Hub Co. is not a traditional travel agency or tour operator selling packaged itineraries. At Connect Hub Co., we believe every traveler deserves more than just transportation and accommodation—they deserve confidence, reliable guidance, and a trusted helping hand throughout their journey. Through our verified network of partners and dedicated local coordinators, we help travelers navigate unfamiliar destinations across India and Nepal with ease, without compromising their independence.\r\n          "
        },
        {
          "kind": "jsx-text",
          "line": 178,
          "value": "SERVICE BOUNDARIES & STANDARDS"
        },
        {
          "kind": "jsx-text",
          "line": 179,
          "value": "Critical Engagement Framework & Boundaries"
        },
        {
          "kind": "jsx-text",
          "line": 181,
          "value": "Connect Hub Co. operates under strict operational boundaries, transparent service terms, and verified background screening.\r\n          "
        },
        {
          "kind": "field:name",
          "line": 186,
          "value": "check"
        },
        {
          "kind": "jsx-text",
          "line": 188,
          "value": "Customer-Defined Boundaries:"
        },
        {
          "kind": "jsx-text",
          "line": 189,
          "value": "The customer establishes and explicitly defines the limitations, scope, and authorized boundaries of the assistant&apos;s role before the service plan is finalized."
        },
        {
          "kind": "field:name",
          "line": 193,
          "value": "check"
        },
        {
          "kind": "jsx-text",
          "line": 195,
          "value": "Logistics & Arrangements:"
        },
        {
          "kind": "jsx-text",
          "line": 196,
          "value": "The customer is responsible for arranging, booking, and providing all meals, accommodation, and travel tickets for the assigned assistant throughout the trip."
        },
        {
          "kind": "field:name",
          "line": 200,
          "value": "check"
        },
        {
          "kind": "jsx-text",
          "line": 202,
          "value": "Employment Status:"
        },
        {
          "kind": "jsx-text",
          "line": 203,
          "value": "Connect Hub Co. operates as an independent service provider. The assigned assistant is not an employee of the customer."
        },
        {
          "kind": "jsx-text",
          "line": 212,
          "value": "DEDICATED SUPPORT"
        },
        {
          "kind": "jsx-text",
          "line": 213,
          "value": "Why Choose Connect Hub Co.?"
        },
        {
          "kind": "jsx-text",
          "line": 215,
          "value": "Modern travel is highly accessible, yet unforeseen challenges such as missed connections, unfamiliar local regulations, language barriers, and sudden medical emergencies can disrupt a well-planned journey. Connect Hub Co. bridges this gap. Customers continue to book their preferred airlines, hotels, and tour operators, while our trained coordinators provide background management and ground assistance. Whether the customer is a newly married couple, senior citizen, NRI family visiting India, family traveler, or solo traveler, the framework ensures physical support is available when required. We act as Your Shadow Traveler—always nearby when needed and never intrusive when not required.\r\n          "
        },
        {
          "kind": "jsx-text",
          "line": 219,
          "value": "Important Note:"
        },
        {
          "kind": "jsx-text",
          "line": 221,
          "value": "Connect Hub Co. is not a traditional travel agency or tour operator selling packaged itineraries. We provide 247 journey management, Shadow Traveler assistance, local ground coordination, and emergency traveler support across major destinations in India and Nepal.\r\n          "
        },
        {
          "kind": "jsx-text",
          "line": 229,
          "value": "TAILORED TRAVEL ASSISTANCE"
        },
        {
          "kind": "jsx-text",
          "line": 230,
          "value": "Our Specialized Services"
        },
        {
          "kind": "jsx-text",
          "line": 232,
          "value": "Explore our specialized travel assistance services designed for high-touch, privacy-first, and emergency journey support.\r\n          "
        },
        {
          "kind": "field:name",
          "line": 237,
          "value": "family"
        },
        {
          "kind": "jsx-text",
          "line": 238,
          "value": "1. Shadow Assistance"
        },
        {
          "kind": "jsx-text",
          "line": 240,
          "value": "Designed for travelers who value independence but also want reliable local backup. We coordinate logistics, remain ready to respond, respect customer privacy, and help keep family members reassured.\r\n            "
        },
        {
          "kind": "field:name",
          "line": 244,
          "value": "check"
        },
        {
          "kind": "jsx-text",
          "line": 245,
          "value": "2. Emergency Family & Personal Support"
        },
        {
          "kind": "jsx-text",
          "line": 247,
          "value": "Provides compassionate on-site crisis coordination when a traveler or family member faces hospitalization or a medical emergency away from home. Representatives may assist with hospital formalities, medical-administration coordination, essential purchases, attendant logistics, family communication, and transparent status updates.\r\n            "
        },
        {
          "kind": "field:name",
          "line": 251,
          "value": "followup"
        },
        {
          "kind": "jsx-text",
          "line": 252,
          "value": "3. 247 On-Trip Support"
        },
        {
          "kind": "jsx-text",
          "line": 254,
          "value": "Provides an active round-the-clock helpline and rapid-response mechanism for updates, urgent guidance, coordination, and emergency support throughout India and Nepal.\r\n            "
        },
        {
          "kind": "field:name",
          "line": 258,
          "value": "guide"
        },
        {
          "kind": "jsx-text",
          "line": 259,
          "value": "4. Safari & Wildlife Assistance"
        },
        {
          "kind": "jsx-text",
          "line": 261,
          "value": "Supports wildlife journeys through permit coordination, local transport assistance, verified partner coordination, and ground-level execution.\r\n            "
        },
        {
          "kind": "field:name",
          "line": 265,
          "value": "online"
        },
        {
          "kind": "jsx-text",
          "line": 266,
