        },
        {
          "kind": "jsx-text",
          "line": 273,
          "value": "6. Customized Theme-Based Travel Planning"
        },
        {
          "kind": "jsx-text",
          "line": 275,
          "value": "Offers tailored journey planning and execution for specific travel themes, pilgrimage circuits, and cultural itineraries across India &amp; Nepal. Support may be customized for:\r\n            "
        },
